.TH QSVG 1 "September 2026" "Qore Cairo module" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
qsvg \- create, convert and manipulate vector graphics and images
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qsvg
.I category action
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ input ]
.br
.B qsvg info
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B qsvg
uses Qore's CairoDataProvider to create SVG, PNG, PostScript, EPS and PDF,
convert SVG and image files, and measure or render text.
Commands read JSON or YAML drawing instructions from a file or inline option.
Explicit output paths replace existing files. For commands that support
in-place processing,
.B --overwrite
selects the input path when no output path is given.
The svg center command modifies its input by default; use -o to select
another output. SVG input uses librsvg, enabled in the Debian package.
.SH CATEGORIES
.TP
.B svg
create, center, info, to-png, to-ps, to-eps, to-pdf.
.TP
.B image
create, info, draw, resize, crop, composite, rotate, to-svg, to-ps, to-eps, to-pdf.
.B img
is an alias.
.TP
.B ps
Create PostScript with the create action; --eps selects EPS.
.B postscript
is an alias.
.TP
.B pdf
Create PDF with the create action.
.TP
.B text
measure, metrics, render.
.TP
.B info
Display module capabilities.
.SH COMMON OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -h ", " --help
Show general, category or action-specific help.
.TP
.BR -V ", " --version
Display version.
.TP
.BR -o ", " --output " " path
Write output to path.
.TP
.B --overwrite
Use the input file as the output for supported in-place operations.
.TP
.BR -W ", " --width " " value
Set output width; vector formats use points, image formats use pixels.
.TP
.BR -H ", " --height " " value
Set output height.
.TP
.BI --commands-file " path"
Read drawing commands from a JSON or YAML file.
.TP
.BI --commands " text"
Read inline drawing commands.
.TP
.BR -C ", " --no-color
Disable terminal colors.
.TP
.BR -v ", " --verbose
Increase verbosity.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
qsvg svg create -W 800 -H 600 --commands-file draw.json -o chart.svg
qsvg svg to-png chart.svg -W 400 -H 300 -o chart.png
qsvg svg to-pdf chart.svg -o chart.pdf
qsvg image resize chart.png --target-width 200 --target-height 150 -o thumb.png
qsvg text render 'Hello' --family 'DejaVu Sans' --size 18 -o label.png
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qore (1)
.br
Use qsvg CATEGORY ACTION --help for action-specific arguments.
